State of Vermont
Senate Chamber
Montpelier, Vermont
Joint Senate Resolution
Offered by Senator Baruth,
J.R.S. 29. Joint resolution relating to weekend adjournment on January 9,
2026.
Resolved by the Senate and House of Representatives:
That when the two Houses adjourn on Friday, January 9, 2026, it be to meet
again no later than Tuesday, January 13, 2026.
